modifications in a header comment):

  crates/ks-browser/build.rs                       <- cli/build.rs
  crates/ks-browser/src/cdp/client.rs              <- cli/src/native/cdp/client.rs
  crates/ks-browser/src/cdp/chrome.rs              <- cli/src/native/cdp/chrome.rs
  crates/ks-browser/src/cdp/types.rs               <- cli/src/native/cdp/types.rs
  crates/ks-browser/cdp-protocol/browser_protocol.json
